                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined a brief opposing Trump\u2019s illegal firings of Gwynne Wilcox (NLRB) and Cathy Harris (MSPB).\u00a0\n\u00a0\u00a0\nWilcox fought for fair treatment and safe conditions for workers. Harris protected whistleblowers and kept the federal workforce accountable.\u00a0\n\u00a0\u00a0\nTrump removed them without cause\u2014violating the law and weakening the agencies that protect everyday Americans.",
