                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "Screenings may seem like a hassle, especially if you think you\u2019re healthy. But knowing what to look for and taking symptoms seriously saved my life, and it may very well save yours too. \n\nSo proud to partner with @nabtweets to promote breast cancer awareness. Get checked and tell your friends and families to make screenings a part of their healthcare routine.",
